DESCRIPTION >
    Hourly Home KPI rollup for `telemetry_events_ch`, materialized via
    `home_kpi_hourly_mv.pipe`. Read via `home_kpi_hourly_api.pipe`
    (`countMerge`/`sumMerge`/`avgMerge`/`quantileMerge` over the
    `AggregateFunction` state columns below) instead of re-scanning
    `telemetry_events_ch` on every Home KPI request. `ClickHouseSink.
    query_home_kpis` (`src/eden/data_platform/clickhouse_sink.py`)
    prefers this rollup on Tinybird and falls back to the live
    single-scan query on `telemetry_events_ch` if the rollup query
    fails or returns no rows (e.g. before the first materialized hour
    has landed for a tenant).

SCHEMA >
    tenant_id String,
    hour DateTime,
    event_count AggregateFunction(count),
    error_count AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    avg_duration_state AggregateFunction(avg, Float64),
    p95_duration_state AggregateFunction(quantile(0.95), Float64)

ENGINE "AggregatingMergeTree"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(hour)"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "tenant_id, hour"
ENGINE_TTL "hour + toIntervalDay(90)"
